#: ../../source/preset-modules_README.md:134
msgid ""
"The output generated by this preset includes workarounds for Safari 10, "
"however minifiers like Terser sometimes remove these workarounds. In "
"order to avoid shipping broken code, it's important to tell Terser to "
"preserve the workarounds, which can be done via the `safari10` option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/preset-modules_README.md:136
msgid ""
"It's also generally the case that minifiers are configured to output ES5 "
"by default, so you'll want to change the output syntax to ES2017."
msgstr ""

